For $n \geq 2$ and $0 \leq i &lt; j \leq n$, we have $d^{n-1}_{i} \circ d^{n}_{j} = d^{n-1}_{j-1} \circ d^{n}_{i}$ (as a map from $C_{n}$ to $C_{n-2}$). 
</p>
</dd>
</dl></p>
